<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: RUGBY UNION-AUSTRALIA TOUR MATCH CALLED OFF DUE TO BAD WEATHER.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-AUSTRALIA TOUR MATCH CALLED OFF DUE TO BAD WEATHER.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia's rugby league tour match against Irish club Leinster scheduled to be played on Tuesday has been called off because of bad weather.</p>
<p>The match will not be rescheduled, officials said.</p>
</text>
